# Sidecar ignore file for sdk/ruby/Dockerfile.
#
# A `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` REPLACES the repository root `.dockerignore`
# entirely for this build — it does not merge with it. That is the point: the
# root file excludes `sdk`, so a build using the repository root as its
# context cannot see the package it exists to test, and the failure reads as a
# missing directory rather than as an ignore rule.
#
# So this file starts from "exclude everything" and admits exactly the two
# paths the image needs.
*

!sdk/ruby/Gemfile
!sdk/ruby/shojiku.gemspec
!sdk/ruby/lib/shojiku/version.rb

# The pre-compiled engine library, built by `make engine:capi-lib`. Gitignored, and
# the root ignore file never mentioned it because nothing else needs it.
!dist/capi/local
